==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|s|y}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*cüvä}} (compare {{cog|et|süva}}), probably from {{inh|fi|fiu-pro|*tiwä}} (compare e.g. {{cog|se|davvi||north}}, {{cog|chm|тӱнӧ}}). Probably also cognate with {{cog|myv|домка}} (initial component)<ref>Vershynin V. Etimologicheskiy slovar mordovskikh (erzyanskogo i mokshanskogo) yazykov, vol. I, p. 67</ref>.

